Objective: Defense of the planet against extensive invasion. Have highest eco-sphere rating by turn 100.

Planet: New Luzon
Clan: Crimson Path

Notes: Our Von Griffin compatriots were savagely reduced defending the planet against the Ayer's Hand. We must take over from them and defend New Luzon against the incoming Chosen clansmen. Be very careful, we think they have been given Concord level weapons to use.

